    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law, in relation to requiring hospitals and\nother facilities that provide perinatal care to implement an evidence-based\nimplicit bias program, to providing birthing parents with written information\nregarding certain patient rights, and to including information related to\npregnancy on death certificates",
    "basePrintNo": "S6983",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6983-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
       "alternate": false,
